pavntwn twðn ajgapwvntwn aujthvn</FOREIGN>   <CITN>( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Qrhvn.</FOREIGN>  I)</CITN> .  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Apanteû oiJ katadiwvkonteû aujthún tuvrannoiv te, kaiú aiJresiavrcai, katevlabon
