eælegen oJ Kuvrioû, 1Egwú thún yuchvn mou tivqhmi uJpeúr twðn
probavtwn</FOREIGN>   <CITN>( <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Iwavn.</FOREIGN>  X)</CITN> :  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kratuvnein deú bouvlei kaiú Oujalentivnou,
kaiú Markivwnoû, Manicaivwn te, kaiú Basilidianwðn,
eæti mhún kaiú 2Ellhvnwn taú qrhskeuvmata. Eij gaúr Qeoúû oJ
