vel tres dominicas sine communione transierint, excommunicantur,
150.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1203">H</CAPTION> <ITEM><HI REND="ITALIC">Haereticorum certa nomina.</HI>  Aetius, 4. Alexander, 10.
